[00:00.00] Thus far, this album has provided musical accompaniment to make your passing pleasant.
[00:08.00] Our next number is designed to drown out the sound of shovels, music to be buried by.
[00:19.00] Of course, your assassin may have made burial unnecessary.
[00:25.00] So, if you are completely encased in cement and are teetering on the edge of a pier,
[00:32.00] please try not to pay attention to this next number. It is not meant for you.
[00:39.00] As for the others, if you spend your evenings watching murder instead of doing it yourself,
[00:47.00] you may recognize this.
